1. Display categories grouped by type (income / expense) in two sections
2. Each category shows its name + colored badge for type
3. "Add Category" button at top opens an inline form or modal
4. Form has fields: name (text input), type (select: income/expense)
5. Each category row has Edit and Delete buttons
6. Edit opens an inline form similar to Add but pre-filled
7. Delete confirms via window.confirm
8. Handle loading state (show 'Loading...') and error state (show error message)
9. Use tailwind for styling - clean, modern look
10. NO shadcn components - plain HTML + tailwind only (as per architecture)
11. The page should match the visual style of the dashboard page (see /Users/shenweizhang/Desktop/ai/run_test_007/frontend/src/app/page.tsx for reference)

